[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6720.709, "timestamp": "01:52:00", "text": "准备好了。所以，呃，准备好那些……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6723.83, "timestamp": "01:52:03", "text": "你认为你会想用它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6726.47, "timestamp": "01:52:06", "text": "哦，一场战斗我能带多少人？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6728.31, "timestamp": "01:52:08", "text": "四、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6730.07, "timestamp": "01:52:10", "text": "你可以带四个人，而且你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6738.79, "timestamp": "01:52:18", "text": "好的。好的。我可以使用同样的法术吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6740.149, "timestamp": "01:52:20", "text": "一次又一次？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6742.31, "timestamp": "01:52:22", "text": "是的，你可以反复使用它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6744.149, "timestamp": "01:52:24", "text": "只要你有法术技能，那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6746.629, "timestamp": "01:52:26", "text": "这些东西。这些就像你的弹药一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6748.55, "timestamp": "01:52:28", "text": "猜测或法力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6752.55, "timestamp": "01:52:32", "text": "哦，如果我的魔法值用完了怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6754.229, "timestamp": "01:52:34", "text": "嗯，你不能施放法术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6755.99, "timestamp": "01:52:35", "text": "不再是了。所以，你需要使用你的“喜欢”功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6757.91, "timestamp": "01:52:37", "text": "你仍然可以投掷罐头脆片。这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6760.149, "timestamp": "01:52:40", "text": "这些都是免费的。但如果你不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6762.149, "timestamp": "01:52:42", "text": "如果你想这样做，你也可以使用你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6764.629, "timestamp": "01:52:44", "text": "呃，像武器一样使用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6767.43, "timestamp": "01:52:47", "text": "哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6770.149, "timestamp": "01:52:50", "text": "是的，这个你可以自己选。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6773.35, "timestamp": "01:52:53", "text": "如果你愿意的话，以后也可以作为其中之一。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6777.109, "timestamp": "01:52:57", "text": "所以，嗯，目前的情况是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6778.47, "timestamp": "01:52:58", "text": "你的第一关。我要把你拉平"}]